      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Immediate action is necessary to prevent spoilage and potential food safety risks. Isolate the affected reefers to prevent cross-contamination with other shipments, and prioritize the cooling and stabilization of the unaffected cargo as soon as possible..lotterm\")]\r\nDo not attempt to open or load or unload any perishable items until the situation is brought under control, prioritize notification of relevant authorities and the origins of the affected seafood.",
